      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 14,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/pwn-heap-tcache-uaf.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:7fcae4a351acd4637155a6fb1efa1549215fe03b196362e0e996636c24291374",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "堆：UAF / tcache 投毒",
      "section": [
        "堆：UAF / tcache 投毒",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 先确认 glibc 版本与 chunk 大小/数量；tcache 与 fastbin 行为不同。\n2. UAF 后改 fd 指向目标（__free_hook、__malloc_hook、栈）；2.32+ 处理 safe-linking。\n3. 用 malloc 两次拿到目标地址，写入 one_gadget/system。\n4. 若目标是任意读，先把 chunk 链到 GOT/栈再分配。",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 18,
      "truncated": false
    },
